[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2650013924","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102689#issuecomment-2650013924","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102689","id":2650013924,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6d9ADk","user":{"login":"AlexanderLife","id":37486189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NDg2MTg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37486189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderLife","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexanderLife","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderLife/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderLife/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderLife/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderLife/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderLife/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderLife/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderLife/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderLife/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderLife/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-11T07:28:46Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T07:28:46Z","body":"Recently I have been having trouble with building godot also from the main repo, it was giving me a segmentation faults in different places, I just now learned from this about scons ---> \n\n--stack-size=KILOBYTES\nSet the size stack used to run threads to KILOBYTES. This value determines the stack size of the threads used to run jobs. These threads execute the actions of the builders for the nodes that are out-of-date. This option has no effect unless the number of concurrent build jobs is larger than one (as set by -j N or --jobs=N on the command line or SetOption in a script).\n\nUsing a stack size that is too small may cause stack overflow errors. This usually shows up as segmentation faults that cause scons to abort before building anything. Using a stack size that is too large will cause scons to use more memory than required and may slow down the entire build process. The default value is to use a stack size of 256 kilobytes, which should be appropriate for most uses. You should not need to increase this value unless you encounter stack overflow errors.\n\nfrom this \nhttps://www.scons.org/doc/HTML/scons-man.html\n\nI don't know if it will help you but it helped me, to add --stack-size=512 to scons. \nso the normal scons line looks like this \n\nscons --stack-size=512\n\nyou might try playing around with the setting, to see if it helps.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2650013924/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2650050364","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102689#issuecomment-2650050364","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102689","id":2650050364,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6d9I88","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mg